WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.421
Explain how to show pride in and care for one’s community.

00:00:04.283 --> 00:00:10.074
A community is a place where people live, work and help one another. We can show

00:00:10.074 --> 00:00:14.055
pride by keeping public areas clean, respecting neighbours and protecting shared

00:00:14.055 --> 00:00:14.417
facilities.

00:00:15.283 --> 00:00:20.825
Do not damage streetlights, school walls or taps. Report serious damage to a trusted

00:00:20.825 --> 00:00:22.409
adult or responsible authority.

00:00:23.283 --> 00:00:27.913
Identify three community facilities and plan one safe way to care for them.
